图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH的插件创意市场来啦!～～～欢迎使用&提供反馈！！DSH 插件创意市场 · DeepSeek Harness 插件发现与一键安装面板 全量嗅探官方 dsh-plugin topic（900+），过滤蹭标签噪音，保留人工精选标记； 支持总星数/最新发布/最近推送排序、即时搜索、语言过滤； 点安装先校验 dsh.bundle 声明，装不了的一律拒绝。零依赖零构建，装进 Web UI 的 Plugins 设置区。","id":"gh:1333715550","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-plugins-market","slug":"Luaphes/dsh-plugins-market","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH的插件创意市场来啦!～～～欢迎使用&提供反馈！！DSH 插件创意市场 · DeepSeek Harness 插件发现与一键安装面板 全量嗅探官方 dsh-plugin topic（900+），过"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"滤蹭标签噪音，保留人工精选标记； 支持总星数/最新发布/最近推送排序、即时搜索、语言过滤； 点安装先校验 dsh.bundle 声明，装不了的一律拒绝。零依赖零构建，装进 Web UI 的 Plugi"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"保留人工精选标记； 支持总星数/最新发布/最近推送排序、即时搜索、语言过滤； 点安装先校验 dsh.bundle 声明，装不了的一律拒绝。零依赖零构建，装进 Web UI 的 Plugins 设置区。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"# dsh-market · Creative Marketplace for DeepSeek Harness Plugins"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> Discover DeepSeek Harness plugins from the official `dsh-plugin` topic — noise-filtered, trust-bad"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ged, one-click install into your profile."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Status: beta, installable.** A persistent npm bundle: install once into your profile, restart the "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"Web UI, and it stays. The `src/` directory holds the equivalent dynamic-plugin reference implementat"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"UI, and it stays. The `src/` directory holds the equivalent dynamic-plugin reference implementation."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Discovery**: crawls GitHub topic `dsh-plugin` (top ~500 repos by stars; rate-limit friendly paci"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ng, first load ~30s, then 10-minute cache) and filters topic-squatting noise\n- **Trust signals**: ba"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"dges for `精选` (human-curated) and community compatibility verdicts (`兼容` / `需适配` / `已删除` / `关注`)\n- *"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"*Ranking & filtering**: by total stars / recent surge / newest / last push (asc/desc toggle), instan"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"t search, language filter; cards show `★ N (+M)` daily star delta when snapshot data covers the repo"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"\n- **Install funnel**: click Install → verify the repo declares `dsh.bundle.patch` in package.json ("},{"id":"p7s7","text":"non-bundles are rejected) → show the exact command with an allowBuilds security warning → confirm → "},{"id":"p7s8","text":"run `dsh plugin --profile <p> add github:owner/repo`"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Restart the Web UI afterwards; a \"Discover plugins\" tab appears under Settings → Plugins. Zero build"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" step, no install scripts, no allowBuilds prompt."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Once published to npm: `dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-plugins-market`"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- Host half: GitHub Search API crawl (rate-limit friendly, 10-minute in-memory cache), merges curate"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"d/compatibility source data, computes star deltas from daily snapshots, install verification & execu"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"tion (approval-gated)\n- Daily snapshots: the `star-snapshots.yml` GitHub Actions workflow records to"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"pic repo stars at 02:00 UTC into `snapshots/YYYY-MM-DD.json`; the market serves deltas computed from"},{"id":"p13s5","text":" the two most recent snapshots\n- Client half: registers the official `settings.plugins.tab` extensio"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"n point, React card list\n- Zero LLM, zero backend, zero user quota: rules + public APIs only"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Source credits"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- Official discovery mechanism: GitHub topic `dsh-plugin`\n- `精选` marks: the catalog content of @0xsl"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ine/awesome-deepseek-harness\n- Compatibility verdicts: the daily radar table of @AdamPlatin123/aweso"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"epseek-harness\n- Compatibility verdicts: the daily radar table of @AdamPlatin123/awesome-dsh-plugins"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Roadmap"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- [x] Persistent npm bundle (installable from GitHub)\n- [ ] npm publish + CI auto-release (Trusted P"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ublishing)\n- [x] Trending (daily star snapshots → \"recent surge\" sort + per-card star delta)\n- [ ] S"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"tandalone web site form (public discovery entry)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
